00:00:51.670 --> 00:00:54.250
The King's Avatar S2

00:00:56.250 --> 00:01:00.920
♪ The dawn piercing horn is being played by now ♪

00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:04.060
♪ Is that a fantasy or just past memories? ♪

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:08.620
♪ Eyes wide open, but I can't tell ♪

00:01:09.430 --> 00:01:12.550
♪ which side of the road am I running on ♪

00:01:12.810 --> 00:01:19.950
♪ Would I know the memories and breaks mixed in morning light? ♪

00:01:20.800 --> 00:01:23.300
♪ They said you shouldn't march on ♪

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:25.800
♪ They said you have to say goodbye ♪

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:30.300
♪ They say you can have no tomorrow but dark night ♪

00:01:30.550 --> 00:01:32.950
♪ Over the finish line ♪

00:01:32.950 --> 00:01:35.420
♪ I will restart my dream again ♪

00:01:35.420 --> 00:01:37.250
♪ Even if it's dangerous ♪

00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:42.430
♪ I will keep marching and get my crown back ♪

00:01:42.430 --> 00:01:45.850
♪ Put on my armor and step to the unknown future ♪

00:01:46.210 --> 00:01:51.020
♪ Hold on to my light on the road together with you ♪

00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:52.120
♪ becomes the power that supports me ♪

00:01:52.270 --> 00:01:55.700
♪ The morning light that burns in my heart ♪

00:01:55.720 --> 00:01:58.050
♪ will blossom at dawn ♪

00:01:58.370 --> 00:02:00.770
♪ Dawn of Glory on battlefield ♪

00:02:00.770 --> 00:02:04.020
♪ I will show you my edge ♪

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:10.020
<b>Happy New Year</b>

00:02:11.140 --> 00:02:16.560
(Thousand Waves Lake)

00:02:19.820 --> 00:02:20.350
Be vigilant.

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:21.400
Be careful of the surroundings.

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:35.850
It's Lord Grim!

00:02:41.340 --> 00:02:42.310
You got balls to come in here.

00:02:44.050 --> 00:02:44.990
Got memory like a fish.

00:02:49.550 --> 00:02:51.550
Happy has gone too far.

00:02:51.550 --> 00:02:54.040
They ambush our elite team on a daily basis.

00:02:55.920 --> 00:02:57.960
I've already got three teams reported to me got ganged.

00:02:57.960 --> 00:03:00.320
They are trying to take the lake for their own.

00:03:00.470 --> 00:03:01.300
This is unacceptable!

00:03:01.800 --> 00:03:03.520
Or we should gather everybody.

00:03:04.720 --> 00:03:06.120
Then Ye Qiu might shrink back.

00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:07.620
Would he?

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:11.430
As soon as I came to this server, I've dealt with Lord Grim.

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:14.170
I've never seen him back off.

00:03:15.370 --> 00:03:18.590
Through all the fights we had
with Ye Qiu, we've gained nothing.

00:03:19.620 --> 00:03:21.470
He always had everything under control.

00:03:21.970 --> 00:03:25.350
I believe Cold Night from Tyranny
knows exactly what I'm talking about.

00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:28.500
Don't you know our stand on this?

00:03:29.070 --> 00:03:29.860
We have our prides, too.

00:03:31.270 --> 00:03:32.390
You think you can hold on to your pride if this continues?

00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:36.470
Ye Qiu is very seasoned outside the battlefield.

00:03:37.350 --> 00:03:38.620
He is overwhelmingly amazing with skills.

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:43.420
Even we know that he is taking over
the lake, there is not much we can do.

00:03:45.570 --> 00:03:49.170
In the face of such an enemy,
you can only choose to give in.

00:03:49.770 --> 00:03:50.470
What?

00:03:51.150 --> 00:03:52.170
No one thinks Ye Qiu started Happy

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:54.200
just for fun, right?

00:03:55.220 --> 00:03:59.320
His Dragon Raising Its Head at All-Stars
was interpreted as a sign of comeback.

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:03.300
Happy will certainly continue to develop and expand,

00:04:03.560 --> 00:04:07.160
and eventually into the public map of all ten servers, Heavenly Domain.

00:04:08.120 --> 00:04:11.470
To lay foundation for his return into the Pro-Alliance.

00:04:12.320 --> 00:04:14.640
Ye Qiu's identity is a great advantage for him.

00:04:15.680 --> 00:04:20.930
The title of the top player in Glory might
not be that important to a newbie in 10th server.

00:04:21.410 --> 00:04:25.150
But in Heavenly Domain, If he reveals that he is Ye Qiu,

00:04:25.150 --> 00:04:29.160
think about it, he will have numerous followers.

00:04:29.850 --> 00:04:31.030
And you want us to back down?

00:04:31.600 --> 00:04:33.440
So that we can just sit and watch Happy be the only lead?

00:04:34.020 --> 00:04:35.850
Yeah, I mean listen to yourself.

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:36.600
Exactly.

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:38.190
Although we are inevitable to fight in the future.

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:41.320
But we can't win in the new server
because we are shorthanded.

00:04:41.820 --> 00:04:44.620
Our chance will come when we
make it to the Heavenly Domain.

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:51.590
Don't you forget, as an Unspecialized
he can't level-up in ordinary areas after level 50.

00:04:52.370 --> 00:04:53.030
That means,

00:04:53.900 --> 00:04:58.770
when he enters Heavenly Domain, he's not going to be a Level 70 but a Level 50.

00:05:01.920 --> 00:05:04.900
A Level 50 has to clear the Heavenly Domain
which is very difficult for even a Level 70.

00:05:05.220 --> 00:05:06.600
This is absolutely unprecedented!

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:08.800
In fact if you think about it,

00:05:09.270 --> 00:05:12.460
Ye Qiu's return to the professional world,
I bet someone's not gonna be happy about this.

00:05:13.320 --> 00:05:16.810
Don't you remember his strange
relationship with Excellent Dynasty?

00:05:19.430 --> 00:05:21.670
Speaking of which, with his ability and name,

00:05:22.010 --> 00:05:24.790
after he retired, he can easily become the guild leader.

00:05:25.860 --> 00:05:28.440
But Excellent Dynasty shows no connection with him at all.

00:05:29.520 --> 00:05:30.700
They must have big problems.

00:05:31.220 --> 00:05:34.970
So even if we don't take the move, when Happy gets big,

00:05:34.970 --> 00:05:37.050
There'll be somebody who's more worried than we are.

00:05:38.120 --> 00:05:39.210
Maybe we can take a step back.

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:43.020
Just show it to Excellent Era
and wait for them to make the move.

00:05:48.150 --> 00:05:49.990
Master, can we cease fire?

00:05:50.270 --> 00:05:51.870
You got us on this one.

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:54.170
Sure.

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:55.550
You wanna take the land or money?

00:05:56.520 --> 00:05:57.150
What?

00:05:57.620 --> 00:06:00.040
Choose land, then we can own this lake.

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:03.400
Choose money, same as before,
I will write you a material list.

00:06:04.250 --> 00:06:05.220
You surrendered.

00:06:05.720 --> 00:06:07.320
then you have to give on something, right?

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:08.920
At least you have two options.

00:06:09.370 --> 00:06:10.200
I'll say that's very considerate.

00:06:10.220 --> 00:06:11.300
Are you freaking kidding me?

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:13.860
Give them Thousand Waves Lake?

00:06:14.400 --> 00:06:15.520
They only have a handful of people in the guild!

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:16.200
How dare them.

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:19.620
As for money, he made a long material list.

00:06:19.620 --> 00:06:20.770
I'll send it to you guys.

00:06:22.920 --> 00:06:24.690
He might just come forward and rob us.

00:06:27.250 --> 00:06:29.900
If we really do the math and pay for this list together

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:32.910
then the lose is somewhat bearable.

00:06:33.150 --> 00:06:36.300
Blue River, whose side you are on?

00:06:36.970 --> 00:06:38.750
I'm just helping you to understand him.

00:06:39.350 --> 00:06:40.700
He has always been like this.

00:06:41.320 --> 00:06:45.470
His conditions will be painful,
but just right below your limit.

00:06:46.600 --> 00:06:47.920
I'm not giving him the land nor the money.

00:06:48.390 --> 00:06:49.200
I don't buy it.

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:51.970
With all the hands in Misty Castle, we're gonna nail him.

00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:53.150
Let's go!

00:06:58.050 --> 00:06:59.370
What is Blue Brook going to do?

00:07:00.250 --> 00:07:00.920
The material.

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:02.320
I agree.

00:07:02.530 --> 00:07:03.650
That's a deal.

00:07:06.450 --> 00:07:08.150
(Happy Net Cafe)

00:07:09.930 --> 00:07:11.140
No
Yes
Confirm on this deal?

00:07:11.140 --> 00:07:11.520
- Your deal has been completed -

00:07:11.920 --> 00:07:13.900
How come only you and Tyranny gave us the materials?

00:07:14.850 --> 00:07:15.870
What are the plans of other guilds?

00:07:18.770 --> 00:07:19.770
Talk.

00:07:20.650 --> 00:07:24.250
Boss, do you really think I'm your spy?

00:07:24.470 --> 00:07:25.370
Now that ain't right.

00:07:26.100 --> 00:07:28.740
As the member of Blue Brook,
you are every right to provide

00:07:28.740 --> 00:07:31.470
info of other guilds to their enemy.

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:33.100
The enemy of the enemy is a friend.

00:07:33.470 --> 00:07:36.670
Which means we are now friends.

00:07:37.030 --> 00:07:38.100
Now you are protecting the enemy.

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:39.240
Shame on you.

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:46.270
Some of them decided to continue this fight in the lake.

00:07:48.170 --> 00:07:50.410
So what's your Plan B, when this goes south?

00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:51.720
You are getting help somewhere?

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:56.250
I'm telling you, in underwater,
even Huang Shaotian is not my match.

00:07:57.870 --> 00:07:58.960
We have so many teams and so many people.

00:07:59.060 --> 00:08:00.620
It only takes one player from every single team.

00:08:02.820 --> 00:08:04.320
I just asked in the Pro's chat group.

00:08:04.570 --> 00:08:06.120
They didn't even know about this.

00:08:06.820 --> 00:08:07.460
Go ahead.

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:08.700
Got more stories?

00:08:10.280 --> 00:08:11.200
I got a team coming.

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:13.020
I have to go.

00:08:13.570 --> 00:08:15.220
Talk to me when you see other guilds.

00:08:16.900 --> 00:08:18.370
Told you I'm not your spy!

00:08:30.270 --> 00:08:31.520
Shit! I'm dead again!

00:08:31.520 --> 00:08:32.150
Me too.

00:08:32.150 --> 00:08:32.710
What's the matter?

00:08:32.710 --> 00:08:33.190
Be careful.

00:08:33.190 --> 00:08:34.620
Just dodge them, OK?

00:08:34.670 --> 00:08:36.230
I'm at 1367, 579.

00:08:36.230 --> 00:08:37.150
Lord Grim's here!

00:08:37.150 --> 00:08:38.370
We got him here too.

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:39.520
We're at 1550, 796.

00:08:39.520 --> 00:08:41.920
How can he be everywhere?

00:08:53.070 --> 00:08:54.180
Ye Xiu, you're still here.

00:08:54.670 --> 00:08:55.520
How was last night?

00:08:57.300 --> 00:08:57.930
Nothing.

00:08:57.930 --> 00:08:59.200
Just killed dozens of them.

00:09:00.280 --> 00:09:01.120
Way to go.

00:09:01.450 --> 00:09:02.360
Keep an eye on it for me, would you?

00:09:02.360 --> 00:09:03.470
Don't let the boss kill me.

00:09:04.070 --> 00:09:05.020
What?

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:07.570
Log out if you wanna take a break.

00:09:08.520 --> 00:09:09.410
No way.

00:09:09.630 --> 00:09:10.930
The other guilds are still there.

00:09:11.270 --> 00:09:12.450
My account has to stay online.

00:09:12.450 --> 00:09:13.520
You know, to motivate them.

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:16.100
You're just evil.

00:09:16.420 --> 00:09:17.270
Is Lord Grim online?

00:09:17.270 --> 00:09:17.750
Yes!

00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:18.800
Is Lord Grim online?

00:09:18.800 --> 00:09:19.400
Yes!

00:09:19.520 --> 00:09:20.550
He is so mean!

00:09:20.900 --> 00:09:21.920
Is he going AFK?

00:09:22.930 --> 00:09:24.590
He's been online for more than 30 hours!

00:09:24.590 --> 00:09:27.440
How would we know if he's AFK or is he really there?

00:09:27.450 --> 00:09:28.150
My god.

00:09:28.150 --> 00:09:31.170
Somebody go destroy his WiFi!

00:09:33.900 --> 00:09:35.300
I'm glad Blue Brook took the deal.

00:09:35.870 --> 00:09:37.850
Got eyes on the target?

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:41.270
W-What are you talking about?

00:09:42.270 --> 00:09:43.720
What are you hesitating about?

00:09:44.120 --> 00:09:45.700
It's also good for Blue Brook.

00:09:46.420 --> 00:09:48.110
Look at how smart is Tyranny.

00:09:48.110 --> 00:09:49.700
Master, you were away this morning, right?

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:51.870
We had eyes on at least three teams this morning.

00:09:51.870 --> 00:09:52.620
Such a pity.

00:09:53.270 --> 00:09:53.850
Really, what about now?

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:54.900
Now we got one.

00:09:55.370 --> 00:09:56.010
Give me the coordinates.

00:09:56.010 --> 00:09:56.550
I'll go.

00:09:58.500 --> 00:10:02.720
(Bind: Congee City)

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:04.590
My rotten luck!

00:10:04.590 --> 00:10:06.050
We ran into him again.

00:10:08.600 --> 00:10:09.520
Herb Garden also got killed?

00:10:11.520 --> 00:10:12.450
Somebody's selling out our locations?

00:10:13.270 --> 00:10:14.590
This is obvious.

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:16.170
It's gotta be Blue Brook.

00:10:16.570 --> 00:10:17.700
We can't get to Ye Qiu.

00:10:18.270 --> 00:10:19.720
But we can definitely get them!

00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:21.700
Kill them all!

00:10:30.860 --> 00:10:31.850
Our people have been dying.

00:10:32.270 --> 00:10:32.970
We've given you the materials.

00:10:33.250 --> 00:10:34.500
How can you still attack us?

00:10:35.820 --> 00:10:36.750
You got it all wrong.

00:10:37.270 --> 00:10:38.600
They got killed by other guilds.

00:10:40.050 --> 00:10:40.720
How would you know?

00:10:42.820 --> 00:10:43.620
You sold them out.

00:10:43.790 --> 00:10:44.800
I think it's fair for them to retaliate.

00:10:46.560 --> 00:10:49.520
You asked us for information
because you knew they would retaliate.

00:10:50.770 --> 00:10:51.770
Don't over think it.

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:54.460
I asked you, for the sake of mutual benefit.

00:10:54.460 --> 00:10:55.250
That's the way it should be done.

00:10:56.150 --> 00:10:57.090
I've got your materials.

00:10:57.280 --> 00:10:58.690
I can do you a favor or two.

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:00.650
If you ever under attack again?

00:11:00.900 --> 00:11:02.070
Bring them to me.

00:11:03.370 --> 00:11:03.990
Wait.

00:11:04.230 --> 00:11:06.740
In this way, all guilds will start
to fight against each other.

00:11:06.970 --> 00:11:10.000
The joint plan to wipe out Happy will vanish on its own.

00:11:11.120 --> 00:11:11.800
It can't be...

00:11:12.170 --> 00:11:14.570
So the minute we disagreed about the settlement,

00:11:15.570 --> 00:11:18.520
Is he already got everything under control?

00:11:39.080 --> 00:11:39.970
He's a quick rat.

00:11:42.300 --> 00:11:43.820
Two-faced asshole.

00:11:44.250 --> 00:11:47.170
I didn't know you have the guts to be a snitch.

00:11:47.450 --> 00:11:49.560
Run, keep running.

00:11:52.350 --> 00:11:54.140
I mean, where do you think you can go?

00:11:54.140 --> 00:11:55.600
You're not getting away with this.

00:11:55.650 --> 00:11:56.820
I mean, come on.

00:12:03.100 --> 00:12:04.350
Lord, Lord Grim!

00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:10.950
Blue River, you piece of shit!

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:12.200
You are despicable.

00:12:12.470 --> 00:12:13.970
You dare to go Solo with me?

00:12:14.670 --> 00:12:15.250
Solo?

00:12:16.450 --> 00:12:17.320
This is not a real contest.

00:12:17.520 --> 00:12:19.320
This is all about outnumbering.

00:12:20.270 --> 00:12:21.050
And you're the leader.

00:12:21.050 --> 00:12:21.920
You're not smart enough for that.

00:12:22.780 --> 00:12:24.520
How can you do the infinite combo underwater?

00:12:25.320 --> 00:12:26.020
Blue River!

00:12:26.620 --> 00:12:28.570
Shame on you!

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:32.500
We'll give you the materials.

00:12:34.170 --> 00:12:35.460
You should have done it in the first place.

00:12:35.970 --> 00:12:37.300
Your persistence didn't mean anything.

00:12:37.720 --> 00:12:38.500
Who will trade first?

00:12:39.320 --> 00:12:40.100
I'll go first.

00:12:42.220 --> 00:12:43.050
Oh, it's you.

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:44.700
Dead five times.

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:45.300
Appreciate your work.

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:47.040
You've been dead three times.

00:12:47.040 --> 00:12:47.820
It must have been hard for you.

00:12:48.250 --> 00:12:48.970
You, four times.

00:12:50.170 --> 00:12:51.060
Woah, you're good.

00:12:51.060 --> 00:12:52.270
You stayed alive.

00:12:52.950 --> 00:12:55.220
So, wanna join us in Happy?

00:12:55.820 --> 00:12:57.800
Lord Grim, f*ck you!

00:12:58.400 --> 00:13:00.820
We need lucky dogs like you.

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:04.620
So many rare materials.

00:13:05.020 --> 00:13:05.430
And they won't mess with us anymore.

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:06.470
Yes
No
in the guild warehouse?
Are you sure to deposit the selected items

00:13:06.470 --> 00:13:07.270
- Deposit Successful

00:13:07.750 --> 00:13:09.070
It's you who mess with people!

00:13:09.770 --> 00:13:10.570
You started first.

00:13:11.870 --> 00:13:12.570
You poached first.

00:13:12.950 --> 00:13:14.380
I just said that I am Ye Qiu.

00:13:14.820 --> 00:13:15.950
And All-accomplished came by himself.

00:13:16.420 --> 00:13:17.370
Is it a crime to tell the truth?

00:13:19.820 --> 00:13:21.910
Finally, can get to Thousand Waves Lake dungeon.

00:13:22.350 --> 00:13:23.480
Got one open spot.

00:13:23.480 --> 00:13:24.270
You in?

00:13:25.520 --> 00:13:26.770
No, thanks...

00:13:33.570 --> 00:13:34.700
The King's Avatar S2

00:13:38.700 --> 00:13:39.270
Mum!

00:13:40.370 --> 00:13:41.350
Goodbye then.

00:13:41.350 --> 00:13:42.150
Thank you, boss.

00:13:42.700 --> 00:13:44.470
Happy New Year!

00:13:44.470 --> 00:13:45.020
Goodbye.

00:13:45.740 --> 00:13:46.470
Happy New Year!

00:13:47.250 --> 00:13:47.800
Safe ride.

00:13:48.770 --> 00:13:49.400
Have a great vacation.

00:13:50.600 --> 00:13:51.570
It's freezing in here. Let's go back inside.

00:13:53.070 --> 00:13:53.710
How about you?

00:13:53.710 --> 00:13:54.720
Got plans for Spring Festival?

00:13:54.920 --> 00:13:55.370
You?

00:13:56.200 --> 00:13:57.150
Work.

00:13:57.150 --> 00:13:58.500
This is my home anyway.

00:13:58.870 --> 00:14:00.790
Boss, we got overtime-pay?

00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:02.350
You're not going home?

00:14:05.520 --> 00:14:06.000
Nice.

00:14:06.620 --> 00:14:08.150
I have a company for this new year.

00:14:09.150 --> 00:14:10.750
Don't we need to decorate for Spring Festival?

00:14:11.400 --> 00:14:13.500
Well, I didn't really think about it.

00:14:14.100 --> 00:14:15.170
This is common sense, OK?

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:19.890
(Excellent Era)

00:14:20.300 --> 00:14:20.850
Mucheng?

00:14:21.950 --> 00:14:23.300
Are you gonna stay in the club this year?

00:14:24.320 --> 00:14:24.900
No.

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:27.850
Going to your families, or friends?

00:14:37.870 --> 00:14:39.370
He's gonna get jumped.

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:42.150
Boss, I'll drop the things here, OK?

00:14:43.800 --> 00:14:45.270
Didn't know I bought all these.

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:46.520
I'm exhausted.

00:14:46.520 --> 00:14:47.300
And thirsty.

00:14:47.970 --> 00:14:49.450
Ye Xiu, you got water?

00:14:50.050 --> 00:14:50.620
Ye Xiu?

00:14:54.850 --> 00:14:56.420
What is he?

00:14:59.470 --> 00:15:00.320
Welcome.

00:15:07.520 --> 00:15:08.200
You...

00:15:09.050 --> 00:15:10.370
what are you doing?

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:14.120
Excuse me, is Ye Xiu there?

00:15:15.620 --> 00:15:17.450
Or should I say Ye Qiu?

00:15:19.520 --> 00:15:20.800
You are?

00:15:22.020 --> 00:15:23.170
I'm his twin brother.

00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:25.000
The real Ye Qiu.

00:15:25.570 --> 00:15:26.270
Twin brother?

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:29.370
So Ye Qiu and Ye Xiu are really two different people.

00:15:30.900 --> 00:15:31.550
Always has been.

00:15:32.470 --> 00:15:33.770
Boss, did you just call me?

00:15:36.020 --> 00:15:37.020
Why are you here?

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:38.950
I'm here to take you home for Spring Festival.

00:15:40.520 --> 00:15:41.930
Father is not doing so good recently.

00:15:42.410 --> 00:15:43.200
Go home and see him.

00:15:45.970 --> 00:15:46.600
This is getting old.

00:15:47.520 --> 00:15:49.720
Well, it's actually mom.

00:15:49.800 --> 00:15:50.570
Keep going.

00:15:51.770 --> 00:15:52.820
Little Dot's dead.

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:54.750
It's about time.

00:15:55.310 --> 00:15:56.120
It lived long enough.

00:15:56.120 --> 00:15:57.220
Who is Little Dot?

00:15:57.270 --> 00:15:57.820
A dog.

00:15:58.850 --> 00:15:59.700
You should come home.

00:16:01.070 --> 00:16:03.270
So go back, and you can run out, right?

00:16:07.220 --> 00:16:08.310
You asshole.

00:16:08.770 --> 00:16:11.240
You stole my luggage, and my identity!

00:16:11.520 --> 00:16:12.760
You've been out for years!

00:16:12.760 --> 00:16:14.100
It should be my turn.

00:16:15.550 --> 00:16:16.220
Silly.

00:16:16.650 --> 00:16:18.550
Don't you see where I'm going with this?

00:16:19.220 --> 00:16:20.950
I'm teaching you what not to do.

00:16:21.700 --> 00:16:23.340
You should thank me.

00:16:23.650 --> 00:16:24.620
Shameless!

00:16:24.620 --> 00:16:25.820
Come home with me!

00:16:25.900 --> 00:16:26.770
Not gonna happen.

00:16:27.600 --> 00:16:29.570
Well, can you be more specific?

00:16:34.350 --> 00:16:36.450
Well, I was going to play in the Pro-Alliance.

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:39.630
If I used my real name, I'm afraid my family will come for me.

00:16:40.650 --> 00:16:43.250
But with a common name like Ye Qiu,
it would draw nobody's attention.

00:16:44.500 --> 00:16:47.250
And this bastard registered with my name!

00:16:49.050 --> 00:16:49.870
I see.

00:16:50.850 --> 00:16:52.210
You used your brother's identity.

00:16:52.550 --> 00:16:54.870
That's why you are both Ye Qiu and Ye Xiu.

00:16:56.370 --> 00:16:59.050
Thanks to me, you're all famous now.

00:17:02.350 --> 00:17:05.240
Who would have thought you ran out just to play in Glory?

00:17:05.240 --> 00:17:06.250
That is so lame.

00:17:11.620 --> 00:17:12.880
You wanted to leave as well.

00:17:13.150 --> 00:17:14.670
What was your plan?

00:17:16.000 --> 00:17:16.720
I...

00:17:16.950 --> 00:17:19.050
Or, did you even have a dream?

00:17:20.550 --> 00:17:22.500
My dream was to run away from home.

00:17:25.300 --> 00:17:26.500
That's the difference between you and me.

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:29.200
If mom and dad really wanted to take me back,

00:17:30.050 --> 00:17:31.130
it would have been easy.

00:17:32.100 --> 00:17:33.820
You know why they didn't do it?

00:17:33.920 --> 00:17:34.400
Why?

00:17:35.600 --> 00:17:36.930
Because they know,

00:17:37.420 --> 00:17:39.020
my dream is to do eSports.

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:40.700
You can only last a few years with this job.

00:17:42.400 --> 00:17:43.100
A home is a home.

00:17:43.570 --> 00:17:44.300
I will go home someday.

00:17:45.970 --> 00:17:49.300
But you, who only dreams about getting away.

00:17:49.670 --> 00:17:50.700
You are more of a rebel than I am.

00:17:51.520 --> 00:17:53.420
If you got out, you think you would be back?

00:17:54.750 --> 00:17:57.370
So, you go home for Spring Festival right now.

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:01.000
I will go when my time is up.

00:18:05.220 --> 00:18:06.150
I don't get to see you that often.

00:18:06.920 --> 00:18:08.120
I can go home tomorrow.

00:18:09.620 --> 00:18:10.500
Be my guest!

00:18:14.600 --> 00:18:15.590
Nice, nice.

00:18:16.070 --> 00:18:17.590
Good, good.

00:18:17.900 --> 00:18:18.970
Not bad, not bad.

00:18:19.970 --> 00:18:20.830
All powerful.

00:18:20.830 --> 00:18:21.750
All my favorite food.

00:18:22.520 --> 00:18:23.600
I didn't know

00:18:23.600 --> 00:18:24.750
you're actually a good brother.

00:18:25.170 --> 00:18:25.820
I'm the man.

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:27.470
Today is New Year's Eve.

00:18:27.720 --> 00:18:29.550
But let's take it as Spring festival.

00:18:30.020 --> 00:18:30.800
Come have a glass.

00:18:31.200 --> 00:18:32.370
I will just drink tea.

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:34.070
Too much alcohol will give you the tremor in hands.

00:18:35.060 --> 00:18:36.260
I forgot about that.

00:18:36.260 --> 00:18:37.450
You wanna take the glass?

00:18:37.970 --> 00:18:38.570
Sure.

00:18:41.100 --> 00:18:42.420
Happy New Year!

00:18:42.420 --> 00:18:43.300
Happy New Year.

00:18:43.300 --> 00:18:44.600
Each one of you got a red pocket.

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:45.900
Thank you, boss.

00:18:47.010 --> 00:18:47.870
I got lucky money.

00:18:52.670 --> 00:18:53.600
He's wasted over only one glass?

00:18:54.000 --> 00:18:54.700
That's lame.

00:18:55.470 --> 00:18:56.170
He can sleep at my place.

00:18:56.670 --> 00:18:57.350
You need help?

00:18:57.820 --> 00:18:58.390
It's OK.

00:18:58.390 --> 00:18:59.270
I got this.

00:19:07.970 --> 00:19:09.520
You're not gonna get wasted for one glass, are you?

00:19:10.270 --> 00:19:11.470
No way.

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:12.950
I'm not the same with him.

00:19:14.450 --> 00:19:15.270
You never drink.

00:19:16.420 --> 00:19:17.970
You may not know how much you can drink.

00:19:19.720 --> 00:19:20.250
Never mind.

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:21.900
It's Spring Festival.

00:19:22.370 --> 00:19:23.220
I'll drink with you for that.

00:19:25.170 --> 00:19:25.950
You don't drink much anyway.

00:19:25.950 --> 00:19:27.150
It won't affect your hands.

00:19:31.770 --> 00:19:33.890
It's nice to have a brother.

00:19:34.300 --> 00:19:37.140
Even though you fight, you still look happy.

00:19:42.520 --> 00:19:43.290
No way.

00:19:45.770 --> 00:19:47.250
It must be I'm too tired today.

00:19:47.820 --> 00:19:49.050
Seriously?

00:19:49.320 --> 00:19:50.270
Only one glass?

00:19:59.850 --> 00:20:00.600
So you're up.

00:20:01.320 --> 00:20:01.990
Morning.

00:20:02.500 --> 00:20:03.430
That punk-ass is still sleeping.

00:20:03.620 --> 00:20:04.650
I threw him in there.

00:20:05.450 --> 00:20:07.320
I went out for a walk and bought some breakfast.

00:20:08.620 --> 00:20:09.350
Thank you.

00:20:11.520 --> 00:20:12.670
Got guest on New Year's Eve?

00:20:18.900 --> 00:20:19.820
Happy New Year!

00:20:23.570 --> 00:20:24.350
Oh, I'm sorry!

00:20:24.600 --> 00:20:26.500
Su, Su Mucheng?

00:20:26.500 --> 00:20:27.840
I'm sorry.

00:20:27.840 --> 00:20:29.120
I thought Ye Xiu did the night shift.

00:20:29.370 --> 00:20:32.020
It would be him to answer the door.

00:20:32.020 --> 00:20:32.800
It's OK!

00:20:32.800 --> 00:20:34.980
Come on in, come on!

00:20:34.980 --> 00:20:36.710
Be at home.

00:20:36.710 --> 00:20:37.750
Just sit anywhere!

00:20:45.270 --> 00:20:45.800
Wait...

00:20:45.800 --> 00:20:46.600
Happy New Year!

00:20:49.050 --> 00:20:49.870
What the heck?

00:20:51.220 --> 00:20:52.380
You are not Ye Xiu.

00:20:52.380 --> 00:20:53.300
You are Ye Qiu?

00:20:54.970 --> 00:20:56.050
Wrong again.

00:20:56.320 --> 00:20:57.270
That's the only one left.

00:20:57.650 --> 00:20:58.600
We can buy some more?

00:21:01.300 --> 00:21:01.920
Oh, you're here.

00:21:04.450 --> 00:21:05.300
Is he gone yet?

00:21:06.850 --> 00:21:07.550
Going.

00:21:08.070 --> 00:21:08.860
So early?

00:21:09.350 --> 00:21:11.000
How about a lunch together?

00:21:11.050 --> 00:21:11.980
I have to leave.

00:21:12.350 --> 00:21:13.670
Or it'll be too late for Spring Festival dinner.

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:15.660
I'm not like some other ungrateful son.

00:21:17.600 --> 00:21:20.020
Well, you take my share and be good at home.

00:21:22.170 --> 00:21:23.630
I didn't live up to my dream yet.

00:21:24.020 --> 00:21:24.720
You'd better come back soon.

00:21:26.270 --> 00:21:27.600
Still haven't given up?

00:21:28.120 --> 00:21:28.650
Goodbye.

00:21:28.800 --> 00:21:29.620
I'll see you off.

00:21:30.120 --> 00:21:30.720
No, it's OK.

00:21:31.300 --> 00:21:33.070
Goodbye, asshole.

00:21:37.170 --> 00:21:38.100
What time does the event start?

00:21:46.100 --> 00:21:46.670
He's gone.

00:21:47.320 --> 00:21:48.750
Yeah, I heard it.

00:21:48.750 --> 00:21:50.220
Then why didn't you say anything?

00:21:50.970 --> 00:21:52.930
OK, my heart is broken.

00:21:53.970 --> 00:21:55.230
The event's not gonna start till noon.

00:21:55.500 --> 00:21:56.430
The day's young.

00:21:56.700 --> 00:21:58.020
Why don't you show me around your place?

00:22:00.670 --> 00:22:01.280
Well...

00:22:02.720 --> 00:22:04.370
It's quite humble.

00:22:06.850 --> 00:22:07.460
It looks great.

00:22:07.770 --> 00:22:09.060
It's very you.

00:22:13.220 --> 00:22:14.150
Come and have a look.

00:22:14.600 --> 00:22:15.270
There's nothing to see.

00:22:17.820 --> 00:22:18.850
You can see my window from here.

00:22:21.530 --> 00:22:22.520
I can see it!

00:22:23.700 --> 00:22:25.370
Your window is in plain sight.

00:22:26.000 --> 00:22:26.800
Don't make a fuss about it.

00:22:28.850 --> 00:22:29.820
It feels so close.

00:22:30.420 --> 00:22:32.570
Maybe we can all say hi to each other in morning.

00:22:33.870 --> 00:22:34.700
Of, of course.

00:22:34.970 --> 00:22:35.800
Let's try it next time!

00:22:37.750 --> 00:22:38.670
I'm heading down first.

00:22:38.670 --> 00:22:39.300
We have no eyes down there.

00:22:39.800 --> 00:22:40.270
Ye Xiu.

00:22:48.770 --> 00:22:49.470
It's a broken one.

00:22:56.000 --> 00:22:57.150
Did you see him?

00:23:19.950 --> 00:23:22.750
♪ If you can't see the sky with your head up ♪

00:23:24.140 --> 00:23:27.850
♪ Then look down and focus on where you're heading ♪

00:23:28.120 --> 00:23:32.670
♪ We all know that we don't want to bury our dreams ♪

00:23:32.670 --> 00:23:34.870
♪ Step back for the next take-off ♪

00:23:37.270 --> 00:23:39.500
♪ All channels are reconnected ♪

00:23:39.800 --> 00:23:41.450
♪ I remember you said you would wait ♪

00:23:41.670 --> 00:23:43.550
♪ Fine melody under my fingertips ♪

00:23:43.550 --> 00:23:45.720
♪ Perfect performance in digital world ♪

00:23:48.450 --> 00:23:50.450
♪ Brand-new melody, brand-new you and me ♪

00:23:50.470 --> 00:23:53.720
♪ Our passion will support us to the end ♪

00:23:53.720 --> 00:23:56.970
♪ Light the fire in you ♪

00:23:56.970 --> 00:23:59.120
♪ Shine away the weakness in dark ♪

00:23:59.120 --> 00:24:00.800
♪ You can laugh at me, you can look down on me ♪

00:24:00.800 --> 00:24:02.600
♪ They would only drive me further ♪

00:24:02.720 --> 00:24:05.850
♪ Take record of our pulses ♪

00:24:08.000 --> 00:24:09.870
♪ All those provocations ♪

00:24:09.870 --> 00:24:12.020
♪ They will only firm my steps ♪

00:24:41.000 --> 00:24:42.920
The Gunner is just like that.

00:24:43.500 --> 00:24:44.270
(Lord Grim, Level 50)

00:24:45.070 --> 00:24:46.850
You bastard, you said you gonna do PVP.

00:24:46.970 --> 00:24:48.250
Why don't you have time for me?

00:24:48.800 --> 00:24:50.070
One Autumn Leaf?

00:24:50.120 --> 00:24:52.220
You're telling me you are Ye Qiu?

00:24:52.920 --> 00:24:53.720
Give me your mouse.

00:24:58.470 --> 00:24:59.070
Grenade.

00:25:05.750 --> 00:25:06.650
Heavenly Domain.

00:25:07.670 --> 00:25:08.420
I'm coming.
